# .cursorrules - AI Data Science & Systems Standard

- Stack: Python 3.11+, DuckDB, XGBoost, FastMCP, LangGraph, Streamlit, Pytest.
- Architecture: 4-Pillar Stack (Data Science, Machine Learning, AI Engineering, MLOps).
- Deep Modules: Build thick underlying logic in `src/engine/` and `src/agent/` behind clean, stable interfaces. Avoid shallow, single-function helper files.
- Semantic Governance: Route query logic through pre-defined metrics in `config/metrics.yml` or DuckDB helper schemas. Never invent raw unconstrained SQL columns.
- TDD Execution: Always write or reference failing boundary tests in `tests/test_guardrails.py` before modifying core engine code.
- Decision Auditability: Track key design trade-offs in `config/decision-log.md`.
